OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 30 Aug to Tue 8 SepFAn
OL,6,Funsettled period is likely, with
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain
OL,8,Fpossible across many parts of the UK.
OL,9,FSome heavy rain is likely, perhaps
OL,10,Fwith some thunderstorms too. Rainfall
OL,11,Famounts will probably be above average
OL,12,Ffor the time year and there is
OL,13,Fpotential for some strong winds at
OL,14,Ftimes. Some drier and more settled
OL,15,Finterludes could develop at times, but
OL,16,Fthese will likely be short-lived.
OL,17,FTemperatures are likely to be near
OL,18,Faverage, although some short-lived
OL,19,Fwarm or very warm spells are possible,
OL,20,Fespecially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
