OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1787669770
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 9 Sep to Wed 23 Sep
OL,6,FMost likely a continuation of the
OL,7,Fgenerally unsettled conditions at
OL,8,Ffirst with showers or longer spells of
OL,9,Frain across many areas, perhaps heavy
OL,10,Fand thundery in places. However, there
OL,11,Fmay still be some brief drier
OL,12,Finterludes at times. Further into
OL,13,FSeptember, drier weather may become
OL,14,Fmore prevalent, especially in the
OL,15,Fsouth and southeast, with any more
OL,16,Funsettled conditions tending to become
OL,17,Fmore likely further north and
OL,18,Fnorthwest. Temperatures will probably
OL,19,Fbe near normal at first but may become
OL,20,Fwarmer later, with the possibility of
OL,21,Fsome hot spells in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
